 "nl": [
  "No packet from vpn-users may enter edge-cache, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Allow edge-cache to connect to library using MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "library must accept HTTP (TCP 80) from vpn-users.",
  "vpn-users offers DNS over UDP 53 to every zone.",
  "Hosts in mail may reach library over SSH (TCP 22).",
  "Restrict mail so that its only permitted destinations are vpn-users on DNS over UDP 53; library on syslog (UDP 514); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "edge-cache must accept HTTP (TCP 80) from hr.",
  "edge-cache must accept PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) from vpn-users.",
  "Any zone may connect to edge-cache over HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "nvr offers DNS over UDP 53 and HTTPS (TCP 443) to every zone.",
  "Hosts in hr may reach mail over MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "edge-cache must accept MySQL (TCP 3306) from nvr.",
  "Hosts in nvr may reach library over HTTPS (TCP 443) and MySQL (TCP 3306) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Restrict nvr so that its only permitted destinations are hr on NTP (UDP 123); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Hosts in library may reach hr over SSH (TCP 22).",
  "Any zone may connect to hr over DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Any zone may connect to vpn-users over NTP (UDP 123) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Any zone may connect to nvr over HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "Make HTTP (TCP 80) and HTTPS (TCP 443) on hr reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Allow library to connect to hr using SSH (TCP 22).",
  "Hosts in library may reach hr over syslog (UDP 514) and SNMP (UDP 161) and SMTP (TCP 25).",
  "Allow vpn-users to connect to hr using RTSP (TCP 554).",
  "No packet from edge-cache may enter library, even for services open to everyone.",
  "edge-cache must accept HTTP (TCP 80) and HTTPS (TCP 443) and RTSP (TCP 554) from library.",
  "vpn-users must accept syslog (UDP 514) from nvr.",
  "Allow vpn-users to connect to library using syslog (UDP 514) and SMB (TCP 445).",
  "Hosts in edge-cache may reach library over SSH (TCP 22).",
  "Permit TCP ports 1024-65535 from edge-cache to nvr but deny PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), MySQL (TCP 3306)."
 ],
